Router TLS credential and trust-bundle rotation for agent-substrate/env.

Ported from Samuel Huber's environment reliability patches. Applies to env
56424de763f91daa6b6c38f6249bacef1d82e5e1 after patches 0001 and 0002.

Re-read the client credential bundle and router CA bundle on each TLS
handshake, caching parsed certificates by content. Verify the current peer
chain, DNS name and server-auth EKU against the current trust bundle.
Tests cover client and CA rotation and reject untrusted, misnamed and
client-only serving certificates. No deployment policy is included.

